WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.129
RCMP Non-Enforcement Timeline.

00:00:03.079 --> 00:00:05.636
A pattern of zero accountability.

00:00:05.636 --> 00:00:13.227
This page documents every major instance where the RCMP received evidence of criminal activity and declined to lay charges.

00:00:13.227 --> 00:00:25.090
Chinese police stations, SNC-Lavalin, foreign election interference, the ArriveCAN procurement fraud, the Emergencies Act bank account freezes — in every case, the evidence was documented and the charges never came.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:28.920
The chronological record of RCMP non-enforcement.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:39.056
From the SNC-Lavalin affair through the Emergencies Act, foreign interference, and Chinese police stations — a decade of documented evidence followed by zero charges against political actors.

00:00:39.056 --> 00:00:41.340
The pattern is unmistakable.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:47.147
Eight documented instances of criminal evidence involving political actors or institutional corruption.

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:50.397
Eight RCMP decisions not to prosecute.

00:00:50.397 --> 00:01:01.988
The accountability system consistently documents violations through Ethics Commissioners, Auditor General reports, public inquiries, and Federal Court rulings — but never produces criminal consequences for the political class.

00:01:01.988 --> 00:01:04.477
The pattern is not incompetence.

00:01:04.477 --> 00:01:06.931
It is structural non-enforcement.
